  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "b3_u06_l1_g1",
      "pattern": "V-다가",
      "meaning_uz": "...ayotganda (ish to'xtab, boshqasi boshlanadi)",
      "meaning_en": "While doing … (and then something happens)",
      "explanation_md": "**-다가** — bir ish-harakat **davom etayotganda** to'xtab, **boshqasi** boshlanishini yoki biror hodisa yuz berishini bildiradi: \"**...ayotganda**\", \"**...ib turib**\".\n\n**게임을 하다가 노트북이 꺼졌어요.** — *O'yin o'ynayotganda noutbuk o'chib qoldi.*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n**-다** o'rniga **-다가** — 받침 ga qarab o'zgarmaydi:\n\n- 하다 → **하다가**, 보다 → **보다가**\n- 먹다 → **먹다가**, 걷다 → **걷다가**\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- Ikkala qismning **egasi bir xil** bo'lsa, odatda: **(저는) 공부하다가 잤어요.** — *O'qib o'tirib uxlab qoldim.*\n- Lekin noutbuk/telefon kabi narsalar bilan hodisa ham bo'lishi mumkin: **과제를 하다가 노트북이 꺼졌어요.**\n- Qisqa shakli **-다**: **가다 말았어요** kabi; og'zaki nutqda **-다가** ko'proq.\n- 8-1 da **살다가 오게 됐어** — yashab turib (keyin) — xuddi shu qoida.",
      "explanation_md_en": "**-다가** shows that while one action is **in progress**, it stops or **something else** happens: \"**while …-ing**\", \"**was …-ing and then**\".\n\n**게임을 하다가 노트북이 꺼졌어요.** — *My laptop shut down while I was gaming.*\n\n### How to form it\n\nReplace **-다** with **-다가** — no change for 받침:\n\n- 하다 → **하다가**, 보다 → **보다가**\n- 먹다 → **먹다가**, 걷다 → **걷다가**\n\n### Remember\n\n- Usually the **same subject** does both: **(저는) 공부하다가 잤어요.** — *I was studying and fell asleep.*\n- But with gadgets an event can interrupt you: **과제를 하다가 노트북이 꺼졌어요.**\n- In 8-1, **살다가 오게 됐어** (\"lived there, then came\") follows the same rule.",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "Har qanday fe'l",
          "condition_en": "Any verb",
          "rule": "V-다 → V-다가",
          "example": "하다가, 보다가, 먹다가"
        }
      ],
